elieve in why is this business  here what are you hoping to accomplish  what is your vision what is your goal  if you are bringing on the wrong people  if your employees are leaving or you're  firing them it's not their fault it's  your fault because you didn't clearly  explain to them what it is that you're  looking for you didn't have high enough  standards to say yeah you have the  skills but you don't believe in what  we're doing so i'm not going to hire you  or you were completely unclear on what  you wanted to do because if your only  goal is to make money you're not going  to make anything  you have to stand for something more you  have to stand for something bigger  and that makes you believe in it more it  helps you bring on the right customers  the right team the right partners the  right suppliers if your supplier doesn't  believe in what you're doing as much as  you do if they have a different vision  or goal  they're not going to bust their ass  excuse my french  to make sure that this thing happens i  hire people i work with companies i  bring people on board who love  entrepreneurship who love what we're  doing who believe in helping business  owners  because that's how we build a great  organization  so start  with a clear understanding of what it is  that you stand for and then everything  in your business  has to meet that standard if it doesn't  you keep searching until you find the  right person it'll take more time  but having standards and going for  quality takes time but when you get the  right people they're not going to leave  you  and they're going to give you everything  they have because they love what you're  all about  you're going to have more fun you're  going to make more money you're going to  have a greater impact too by the way  believe believe believe believe for  those of you watching you like the video  please give it a thumbs up below i'll do  more videos for you and i want to hear  what you have to think please leave a  comm